{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/5b80549c9b852eef568025eead4159b8.avif?t=1772567378\" width=500 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cloudspan is a bite\u2011sized city builder with a twist: every structure you place obeys real physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It's simple, playful, and endlessly replayable.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge mode</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple\u2014push your city as far as gravity will allow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/0e082b4b40405889740dd78c7d20a850.poster.avif?t=1772567378\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/0e082b4b40405889740dd78c7d20a850.webm?t=1772567378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/0e082b4b40405889740dd78c7d20a850.mp4?t=1772567378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Creative Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No scores, just you and your architectural dreams.\u00a0Build freely, experiment with shapes, and create impossible architecture without pressure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/3b2c4e24356e6b02660b0032fb53fe59.poster.avif?t=1772567378\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/3b2c4e24356e6b02660b0032fb53fe59.webm?t=1772567378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/3b2c4e24356e6b02660b0032fb53fe59.mp4?t=1772567378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Speed Mode</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock to build the biggest city before everything collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Randomly generated islands</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/3b476f0b0c29a37a890bdca7ba53b92b.poster.avif?t=1772567378\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/3b476f0b0c29a37a890bdca7ba53b92b.webm?t=1772567378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/3b476f0b0c29a37a890bdca7ba53b92b.mp4?t=1772567378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Unlock unique building styles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/ab73cbc5edcd784d9bed7669e0510ce6.poster.avif?t=1772567378\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/ab73cbc5edcd784d9bed7669e0510ce6.webm?t=1772567378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/ab73cbc5edcd784d9bed7669e0510ce6.mp4?t=1772567378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing\u2026 Until It Isn\u2019t</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloudspan is easy to pick up, but the moment your structure starts to lean, the tension rises.<br>Will your masterpiece hold together\u2014or collapse in a satisfying cascade?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a master planner or a chaotic stacker, <i>Cloudspan </i>turns urban design into a high-stakes balancing act.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987460?t=1772567378","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/efc289b657286c5852cecc2d858cba839f5873e5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772567378","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/99cc713513c020d2c15fcbdad79b12fc0c311347/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772567378","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/99cc713513c020d2c15fcbdad79b12fc0c311347/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772567378","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4446740,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/5b80549c9b852eef568025eead4159b8.avif?t=1772567378\" width=500 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cloudspan is a bite\u2011sized city builder with a twist: every structure you place obeys real physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It's simple, playful, and endlessly replayable.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge mode</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple\u2014push your city as far as gravity will allow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/0e082b4b40405889740dd78c7d20a850.poster.avif?t=1772567378\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/0e082b4b40405889740dd78c7d20a850.webm?t=1772567378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/0e082b4b40405889740dd78c7d20a850.mp4?t=1772567378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Creative Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No scores, just you and your architectural dreams.\u00a0Build freely, experiment with shapes, and create impossible architecture without pressure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/3b2c4e24356e6b02660b0032fb53fe59.poster.avif?t=1772567378\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/3b2c4e24356e6b02660b0032fb53fe59.webm?t=1772567378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/3b2c4e24356e6b02660b0032fb53fe59.mp4?t=1772567378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Speed Mode</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock to build the biggest city before everything collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Randomly generated islands</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/3b476f0b0c29a37a890bdca7ba53b92b.poster.avif?t=1772567378\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/3b476f0b0c29a37a890bdca7ba53b92b.webm?t=1772567378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/3b476f0b0c29a37a890bdca7ba53b92b.mp4?t=1772567378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Unlock unique building styles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/ab73cbc5edcd784d9bed7669e0510ce6.poster.avif?t=1772567378\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/ab73cbc5edcd784d9bed7669e0510ce6.webm?t=1772567378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/extras/ab73cbc5edcd784d9bed7669e0510ce6.mp4?t=1772567378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing\u2026 Until It Isn\u2019t</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloudspan is easy to pick up, but the moment your structure starts to lean, the tension rises.<br>Will your masterpiece hold together\u2014or collapse in a satisfying cascade?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a master planner or a chaotic stacker, <i>Cloudspan </i>turns urban design into a high-stakes balancing act.</p>","developers":["Cosmo Gatto"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987460/bd43ff646ee9e9466654c46bd725c37b0a9058e0/header.jpg?t=1772567378","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3987460/1146766111/e5303d5191585bb99289c3b33019a25065d52255/1771808809/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771809098","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3987460/1146766111/e5303d5191585bb99289c3b33019a25065d52255/1771808809/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771809098","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3987460/1146766111/e5303d5191585bb99289c3b33019a25065d52255/1771808809/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771809098","id":257292478,"name":"Mini trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257292478/d5c279d38565a2728d7a71a9ae114a6e44183152/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771809098"}],"name":"Cloudspan","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 10, 11, 12 or Vulkan<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Cosmo Gatto"],"ratings":{"dejus":